"text":"Persistent lameness. Pain in lumbar region\nand in lower left shoulder-blade; chest feels tight"},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"urinary","label":"Urinary","startLine":12910,"endLine":12913,"text":"Renal inefiiciency and uraemia. Garlicky\nodor. Diabetes. Urine of high specific gravity; in-\ncreased, acetones and diacetic acid."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"male","label":"Male","startLine":12914,"endLine":12918,"text":"Perspiration of scrotum; is constantly damp\nand moist. Boils on scrotum. Purulent discharge of\na white color from urethra; tingling and burning in\nurethra; pain in prostate; pains in penis."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"extremities","label":"Extremities","startLine":12919,"endLine":12922,"text":"Cramps in calves of legs, worse after\nmidnight, only relieved by getting out of bed and stand-\ning. Ulcers ; gangrene."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"skin","label":"Skin","startLine":12923,"endLine":12926,"text":"Cold, clammy perspiration of an intermittent\nnature. Acne, pustules on face and in the cruro-genital\nregion ; ulcers look like chancre. Gangrene ; carbuncles."}],"corpusPassages":[]}